      "href": "/printed-luxury-kraft-bags/",
      "text": "Kraft paper bags Unbleached brown kraft, 180-250gsm. The everyday British carrier: strong, cheap to print, recyclable with the paper. Twisted, rope or die-cut h"
    },
    {
      "tag": "a",
      "href": "/luxury-laminated/",
      "text": "Laminated bags Matt or gloss film over the print. Holds colour under rain and handling, so it suits salons, hotels and premium retail. Rope or ribbon handles"
    },
    {
      "tag": "a",
      "href": "/printed-luxury-un-laminated/",
      "text": "Un-laminated bags Coated board with no film. A quieter, paper-first finish that boutiques tend to prefer. Ribbon or cotton handles"
    },
    {
      "tag": "a",
      "href": "/printed-twisted-handle-bags/",
      "text": "Twisted handle bags Machine made or overprinted, white or brown kraft. The workhorse of the high street counter. Twisted paper handles"
    },
    {
      "tag": "a",
      "href": "/printed-folded-handle-bags/",
      "text": "Folded handle bags Flat paper handles glued inside or out. Packs down small, stacks well, carries a full order without tearing. Internal or external handles"
    },
    {
      "tag": "a",
      "href": "/luxury-rope-handle-paper-bags/",
      "text": "Rope handle bags Heavier board with cotton or PP rope. What you reach for when the bag has to look like part of the product. Rope, ribbon or herringbone"
    },
    {
      "tag": "a",
      "href": "/printed-counter-bags/",
      "text": "Counter & block bottom Flat counter bags and block bottom bags that stand open while you fill them. Greaseproof stock available. No handles, strung or unstrung"
    },
